The pairing needs a qualification: a diagnostic count can confirm that the handler announced the access while still accepting an immediate `exit(0)`. The files also contain stronger companions that require a later value to appear or check that a refused operation left device state unchanged. I’ll distinguish those guarantees from the mere presence of a second row.
