63:       would therefore leave every one of them green while making an unimplemented
64:       op ALIAS ONTO an implemented case -- 0x05000000 would be DRAWN AS LINE
65:       instead of declined, which silently draws rather than wrongly refusing.
401: 
402: # ------------------------------------------------------------ controls (c)
403: #  Clause (ii) of the witness ladder: an access witness owes a LIVENESS control
